{"id":"n28236-1-15","stage":1,"title":"수요일 · 星期三","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28236-1-15-1","ko":"우리 수요일에 강으로 놀러 갈까?","zh":"我们周三去河边玩怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수요일에","meaning":"星期三，周三，礼拜三","explanation":"수요일：星期三，周三，礼拜三；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"수요일","audio":"/audio/4ee1e5308220dcf13ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28236","senseId":"1","lemma":"수요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"강으로","meaning":"江，河","explanation":"강：江，河；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"강","audio":"/audio/d90ed2084b71f17cebe5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30203","senseId":"1","lemma":"강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀러","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈까?","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"4ee1e5308220dcf1","term":"수요일","zh":"星期三，周三，礼拜三","audio":"/audio/4ee1e5308220dcf13ba5.mp3","entryId":"28236","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的第三天。","pronunciation":["수요일"]},{"id":"d90ed2084b71f17c","term":"강","zh":"江，河","audio":"/audio/d90ed2084b71f17cebe5.mp3","entryId":"30203","definition":"又宽又长、最后流入大海的水流。","pronunciation":["강"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ada2eba3a29dffa1ef54.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28236-1-15-2","ko":"안 돼. 중요한 약속이 있거든. 다음 주에 가자.","zh":"不行，我有很重要的约会。下周再去吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중요한","meaning":"重要","explanation":"중요하다：重要；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"중요하다","audio":"/audio/09f31215bf005060eaf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91873","senseId":"1","lemma":"중요하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"약속이","meaning":"约定，约好，承诺","explanation":"약속：约定，约好，承诺；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36695","senseId":"1","lemma":"약속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있거든.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주에","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去，前往","explanation":"가다：去，前往；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"3","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"09f31215bf005060","term":"중요하다","zh":"重要","audio":"/audio/09f31215bf005060eaf0.mp3","entryId":"91873","definition":"贵重且必不可缺。","pronunciation":["중ː요하다"]},{"id":"a39ee87db456831e","term":"약속","zh":"约定，约好，承诺","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3","entryId":"36695","definition":"事先决定与他人一起做某事；或指那样定下的内容。","pronunciation":["약쏙"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，前往","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为参加某种聚会而移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/386e9cdebb4385ee87b5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.805,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordN